    "detailed_description": "Build your best 11 from your favourite team.<br>Carefully choose your formation and tactics to outwit your opponents.<br>Watch as your team battles it out to try and win!<br><br><strong>Tournament Mode</strong><br>Take your team into a winner-takes-all tournament, where you must take 4 successive victories to lift the cup.<br>Do you have what it takes to lead the last team standing?<br><br><strong>Single Match</strong><br>Refine your tactics in a one-off match against another side.<br>Find what makes your team tick and how to win!<br><br><i><u>Online play</u></i><br>Test your skills against an online opponent, either in a tournament contest or single match.<br>Or, match-up against a friend and battle for the bragging rights!<br><br><i><u>Offline play</u></i><br>Take your team anywhere with you and match up against the AI<br>Choose your opponent and find their weakness!",
